# 统一换行：仓库里一律存 LF，检出到工作区也是 LF。
# Hexo 主题里有大量 CSS/JS/EJS，CRLF 会让 diff 出现整文件改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不要被当文本处理
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.tgz   binary

# GitHub 语言统计：主题是 CSS + EJS，别把 Markdown 算成主语言
*.md   linguist-documentation
DESIGN-CONTRACT.md linguist-documentation
